sequenceDiagram
    participant PO as Product owner
    participant DM as Delivery manager
    participant ARCH as Architecture subprocess
    participant DEV as .NET implementation slice
    participant QA as QA lead
    participant SEC as Security reviewer
    participant PS as Project structure
    PO->>DM: .NET scope and app type boundary
    DM->>ARCH: Start architecture design/review subprocess
    ARCH-->>DM: App classification and reviewed architecture handoff
    DM->>DEV: Start .NET implementation slice subprocess
    DEV-->>DM: Change set, tests, and validation handoff
    QA->>DM: QA accepted or repair required
    alt quality accepted
        SEC->>DM: Security review
        DM->>PS: Write Run command, Run app, Run tests
        QA->>PS: Write Screenshots assets or no-UI receipt
        DM->>DM: Release approval
    else repair required
        DM->>DEV: Repair findings
        QA->>DM: Recheck accepted or escalation
    end
